  "disableMarkdown": false,
  "pages": [
    { "idx": 0, "label": "1", "overlay": 0, "note": "[45s] **Welcome.** Click the slide or press **s** or **→** to start the clock. Then click the slide or press **→** to advance.\n\nOpen **Settings** with `,` or **Help** with `?`." },
    { "idx": 1, "label": "2", "overlay": 0, "note": "[105s] The audience window opens when you present. If your browser blocks it, allow pop-ups and press **o**.\n\n- **Projector** (`Shift+W`) puts the audience fullscreen on a second screen or projector. If remote fullscreen is unavailable, drag the audience window to that display and double-click it.\n- **Sharing** (`Shift+O`) fits the audience window to the slide's proportions, even with one screen. Select the audience window in Zoom, Meet, or Teams and return to the presenter for your notes and controls." },
    { "idx": 2, "label": "3", "overlay": 0, "note": "[60s] Three reveal steps share one page label, so they count as **one slide**.\n\nClick or press **→** to reveal the next step. The *Next* pane previews the next slide." },
    { "idx": 3, "label": "3", "overlay": 1, "note": "[40s] Step two of three. A step can take its own time." },
    { "idx": 4, "label": "3", "overlay": 2, "note": "[50s] Last step. `Shift+PageDown` moves to the next slide from any step. Going back from that slide returns to the first step." },
    { "idx": 5, "label": "4", "overlay": 0, "note": "[90s] Press `l` or `2` to toggle the laser. Press `1` to turn it off. Move the mouse over the presenter's current slide to point for the audience.\n\n`+` and `-` resize the laser while it is on." },
    { "idx": 6, "label": "5", "overlay": 0, "note": "[120s] 各位老师好，这一页的备注是中文。备注字号可以用 `+` 和 `-` 调整，`[` 和 `]` 调整幻灯片的大小。\n\n[ref] A note can open with a planned length like `[120s]`. The pace lines under the slides use that length." },
    { "idx": 7, "label": "6", "overlay": 0, "hidden": true, "note": "Normal navigation skips this slide. Press `g` and enter 6, or select it in **Overview** (`v`) or in the thumbnails at the right edge." },
    { "idx": 8, "label": "7", "overlay": 0, "note": "[60s] The end slide marks the planned end of the talk. You can still move on to the backup slide." },
    { "idx": 9, "label": "8", "overlay": 0, "note": "[30s] Backup material has its own 30-second pace line. The talk's clock keeps running and the early or late estimate includes the time spent here. If you jumped here, press `Shift+Backspace` to return." }
  ]
}
